will be details to come soon re nomination program!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-10T09:25:30.674Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":25,"readers_count":24,"score":35.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1498,"topic_slug":"aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration","display_username":"Jackson Lewis","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":817,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration/1498/3","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2543,"name":"Brightly Stake","username":"Brightly_Stake","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/brightly_stake/{size}/458_2.png","created_at":"2024-08-10T20:44:08.775Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ein support of this proposal\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-10T20:44:08.775Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":25,"readers_count":24,"score":50.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1498,"topic_slug":"aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration","display_username":"Brightly Stake","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":460,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration/1498/4","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2545,"name":"Henri | Stakin","username":"Henri","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/henri/{size}/862_2.png","created_at":"2024-08-12T06:14:33.259Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHenri from Stakin here. We support this proposal, but sharing some thoughts for future consideration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLimit of nomination pools - Yes, we reached this limit quite fast, so increasing the limit to 100 could make sense. However, at the same time, we also need to review the nominations of each pool, to ensure all validators get represented. Not sure how to tackle this yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLimit of participants in each pool - Full support. We could increase the limit even higher, to avoid the situation where SubWallet needs to create multiple pools just for their users, thus using up the limited space for nomination pools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommission limit - Don’t see the need for this, to be honest. Is there an issue with too high fees on nomination pools? Generally, this works in the opposite, that there is a minimum fee, so we avoid dumping the market and allow everyone to earn a fair fee while still letting the market to self-regulate.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-12T06:14:33.259Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":23,"readers_count":22,"score":119.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":1498,"topic_slug":"aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration","display_username":"Henri | Stakin","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":5}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1001,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration/1498/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":5}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":5,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2546,"name":"Dimitri Nikolaros","username":"diminiko","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/diminiko/{size}/785_2.png","created_at":"2024-08-12T10:39:45.215Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ebountyblok in support for this proposal. Personally, I think it’s a big win for large user base projects which can then benefit the entire ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-12T10:39:45.215Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":21,"readers_count":20,"score":54.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":1498,"topic_slug":"aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration","display_username":"Dimitri Nikolaros","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":904,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration/1498/6","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2548,"name":"Shez","username":"shez","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/ee7513/{size}.png","created_at":"2024-08-12T10:58:47.644Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgree with the proposal. We aka Staking4all currently have a pool, it is growing fast and we expect we will hit the 1000 limit of participants per pool. Would be great if we can increase this limit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso due to all 50 pools already been created, we can not create a 2nd pool.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo happy with all suggestions in this post so that pools can be used more easily with less limitations.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-12T10:58:47.644Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":49.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1498,"topic_slug":"aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration","display_username":"Shez","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":977,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/aip-1-update-nomination-pool-configuration/1498/7","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":2550,"name":"CoinStudio","username":"CoinStudio","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/coinstudio/{size}/101_2.png","created_at":"2024-08-12T12:40:49.370Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey everyone,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m positively surprised by the pace and number of users participating in the nomination pools—it’s truly remarkable! A big thumbs up to the Subwallet team for exceeding all expectations and onboarding this many nominators.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur main Pool \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#6\u003c/span\u003e is now close to reaching the current limit of 1000 users, which is an exciting milestone. We are looking forward to the removal of the user upper limit limitation to accommodate even more participants.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCoinStudio is fully in support of AIP1, and we believe it will greatly benefit the community as a whole.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCoinStudio Team\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":9,"updated_at":"2024-08-12T12:40:49.370Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":19,"readers_count":18,"score":48.8